{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>In that day:</b> The sense is: when the word of YHWH is not found, the maidens will thirst — even the beautiful ones — such that their beauty avails them nothing, for they grow loathsome from excess grief; likewise the young men, for HaShem has turned away from them, like Saul whom HaShem did not answer — neither by Urim, nor by dreams, nor by prophets."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:36.758477535Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}